{"title":"Career Roadmap · Translator","role":"Translator","summary":"A Translator converts written content accurately from one language into another while preserving its meaning, context, tone, terminology and intended purpose.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BA graduate specialising in Hindi or another Indian regional language, this is a relevant career path—particularly when the student combines strong language proficiency with English, translation technology, domain knowledge and digital tools."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"A BA language graduate can enter junior translation and language-support roles, but professional translation is increasingly moving toward specialised, technology-assisted translation. Simply knowing two languages is no longer enough for many higher-value roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Primary function"},{"text":"Written language translation"}],[{"text":"Main language combination"},{"text":"Regional/Indian language ↔ English and/or another language"}],[{"text":"Common sectors"},{"text":"Publishing, media, government, legal, education, healthcare, technology, tourism, e-commerce"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Junior Translator / Translation Associate / Language Executive"}],[{"text":"Related roles"},{"text":"Localization Executive, Language Specialist, Content Translator, Subtitler"}],[{"text":"Core strengths"},{"text":"Language proficiency, accuracy, research, writing"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"CAT tools, translation memory, terminology management, QA tools, AI-assisted translation"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"Senior Translator → Language Specialist → Localization/Translation Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"Translator generally refers to written language."},{"type":"p","text":"Interpreter refers to spoken language."},{"type":"p","text":"A student interested in spoken communication should consider interpreting as a related but distinct career."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Translator Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional translator may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Articles"},{"text":"Books"},{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Government documents"},{"text":"Business documents"},{"text":"Educational material"},{"text":"Legal documents"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Marketing content"},{"text":"Subtitles"},{"text":"Software interfaces"},{"text":"Mobile applications"},{"text":"Healthcare information"},{"text":"Research papers"},{"text":"News content"},{"text":"E-learning material"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The workflow is generally:"},{"type":"h","text":"Source document"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand context"},{"type":"h","text":"Research terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Translate"},{"type":"h","text":"Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Edit"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality assurance"},{"type":"h","text":"Final delivery"},{"type":"p","text":"A good translator does not simply replace words from one language with equivalent words in another."}]},{"heading":"Language Combination Matters","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an Indian-language translator, a strong combination could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hindi"},{"type":"h","text":"Hindi ↔ English"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Hindi ↔ English ↔ another Indian language"},{"type":"h","text":"Telugu"},{"type":"h","text":"Telugu ↔ English"},{"type":"h","text":"Tamil"},{"type":"h","text":"Tamil ↔ English"},{"type":"h","text":"Kannada"},{"type":"h","text":"Kannada ↔ English"},{"type":"h","text":"Malayalam"},{"type":"h","text":"Malayalam ↔ English"},{"type":"p","text":"And similarly for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marathi"},{"text":"Bengali"},{"text":"Gujarati"},{"text":"Punjabi"},{"text":"Odia"},{"text":"Urdu"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The broader the professional language combination, the more potential markets become available."},{"type":"p","text":"However, depth of proficiency is more important than collecting many languages at a basic level."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During Your Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Language Mastery"},{"type":"p","text":"The first priority is achieving excellent command of the chosen language."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Vocabulary"},{"text":"Sentence construction"},{"text":"Spelling"},{"text":"Punctuation"},{"text":"Reading comprehension"},{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Cultural context"},{"text":"Idioms"},{"text":"Regional variations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"At the same time, strengthen English because English is one of the most important source/target languages in the Indian translation market."},{"type":"h","text":"Daily practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Read:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Editorials"},{"text":"Books"},{"text":"Government publications"},{"text":"Business articles"},{"text":"Technical content"},{"text":"Digital media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Read the same topic in both languages whenever possible."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Translation Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start systematic translation practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literal vs contextual translation"},{"text":"Paraphrasing"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Transcreation"},{"text":"Terminology research"},{"text":"Style guides"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Fact checking"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practice different content"},{"type":"p","text":"Translate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News articles"},{"text":"Business articles"},{"text":"Educational content"},{"text":"Tourism content"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Government notices"},{"text":"Short technical documents"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not rely on direct word-for-word translation."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Specialisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where employability can increase significantly."},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two domains."},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Agreements"},{"text":"Legal terminology"},{"text":"Government documents"},{"text":"Compliance terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software"},{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"Product manuals"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"User guides"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare terminology"},{"text":"Medical documents"},{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical terminology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"High accuracy is essential in this domain."},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Investment terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News"},{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Subtitles"},{"text":"Scripts"},{"text":"Digital media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Brand messaging"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Transcreation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Translation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the programme is four years, develop professional workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation project management"},{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology databases"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Freelance operations"},{"text":"Pricing and quotations"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Version control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build a portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 10–15 strong translation samples rather than simply collecting certificates."},{"type":"p","text":"Example portfolio:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English → Hindi article"},{"text":"Hindi → English article"},{"text":"English → Telugu business document"},{"text":"Product localization"},{"text":"Website localization"},{"text":"Tourism brochure"},{"text":"Technical manual sample"},{"text":"Government-style document"},{"text":"Subtitle sample"},{"text":"Marketing/transcreation sample"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Language mastery"},{"text":"Grammar, writing, reading, vocabulary"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Translation techniques, editing, proofreading"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Legal/technical/medical/media/marketing"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professionalisation"},{"text":"CAT tools, portfolio, QA, client workflow"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Bilingual News Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Select 10 news articles and produce:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Original","Translation","Translator's notes"]},{"type":"p","text":"Explain difficult terminology and cultural choices."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Website Localization"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a fictional website and translate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Homepage"},{"text":"About page"},{"text":"Product pages"},{"text":"FAQs"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Error messages"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Pay attention to local cultural language, not merely literal translation."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — E-Commerce Localization"},{"type":"p","text":"Translate product listings including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product title"},{"text":"Description"},{"text":"Features"},{"text":"Specifications"},{"text":"Instructions"},{"text":"Customer-facing messages"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create versions for:"},{"type":"p","text":"English → Hindi / Telugu / Tamil / etc."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Subtitle Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Translate a short video."},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Character limits"},{"text":"Natural dialogue"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Subtitle segmentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools such as subtitle-editing software can be used for practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Domain Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one specialist field."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"English → Telugu Medical Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a glossary of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English term"},{"text":"Regional-language equivalent"},{"text":"Definition"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Preferred translation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates terminology management, an important professional skill."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Look for internships in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation agencies"},{"text":"Publishing houses"},{"text":"Media organisations"},{"text":"News organisations"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"E-learning companies"},{"text":"Localization companies"},{"text":"Government-related language projects"},{"text":"Subtitling companies"},{"text":"Content agencies"},{"text":"Travel companies"},{"text":"Multilingual technology companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation Intern"},{"text":"Language Intern"},{"text":"Content Intern"},{"text":"Localization Intern"},{"text":"Proofreading Intern"},{"text":"Subtitling Intern"},{"text":"Language Quality Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Translation Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important areas for the future."},{"type":"p","text":"Professional translators increasingly work with Computer-Assisted Translation (CAT) tools."},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include platforms/tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trados"},{"text":"memoQ"},{"text":"Phrase"},{"text":"Wordfast"},{"text":"Smartcat"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact tools used depend on the employer or client."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the concepts behind CAT tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"Glossaries"},{"text":"Segment-based translation"},{"text":"Translation units"},{"text":"Consistency checking"},{"text":"QA checks"},{"text":"Version management"}]}]},{"heading":"AI-Assisted Translation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is changing translation significantly."},{"type":"p","text":"Tools can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First-pass translation"},{"text":"Terminology suggestions"},{"text":"Grammar correction"},{"text":"Style adaptation"},{"text":"Summarisation"},{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Quality checks"},{"text":"Multilingual content generation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But professional translators should not blindly accept machine-generated translations."},{"type":"p","text":"A professional workflow can be:"},{"type":"h","text":"Source"},{"type":"h","text":"AI/MT draft"},{"type":"h","text":"Human review"},{"type":"h","text":"Terminology verification"},{"type":"h","text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality assurance"},{"type":"h","text":"Final translation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is often called machine translation post-editing (MTPE)."}]},{"heading":"Why Human Translators Still Matter","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can produce grammatically fluent text while still getting the meaning, context or cultural nuance wrong."},{"type":"p","text":"Human expertise remains particularly important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal content"},{"text":"Medical content"},{"text":"Government documents"},{"text":"Sensitive communications"},{"text":"Literary translation"},{"text":"Brand messaging"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Complex technical content"},{"text":"Confidential information"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the future is increasingly:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human linguistic expertise + AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human translator vs AI"}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, realistic entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Translator"},{"text":"Translator"},{"text":"Translation Associate"},{"text":"Language Executive"},{"text":"Language Specialist – Junior"},{"text":"Translation Coordinator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Localization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Localization Executive"},{"text":"Localization Associate"},{"text":"Localization QA Associate"},{"text":"Language QA Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bilingual Content Writer"},{"text":"Regional Content Executive"},{"text":"Multilingual Content Executive"},{"text":"Language Content Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Subtitle Translator"},{"text":"Subtitle Editor"},{"text":"Captioning Executive"},{"text":"Transcription & Translation Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI/Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language Data Annotator"},{"text":"Linguistic Data Associate"},{"text":"AI Language Specialist"},{"text":"Language Quality Analyst"},{"text":"AI Data/Language Evaluation Associate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact job title depends heavily on the language and employer."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Native/regional language"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"English"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Terminology research"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Cultural awareness"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Working/Strong"}],[{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"MTPE"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"AI tools"},{"text":"Working knowledge"}],[{"text":"MS Word"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic/Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Domain knowledge"},{"text":"Specialised"}],[{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"Essential"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Legal Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Agreements"},{"text":"Legal notices"},{"text":"Regulatory documents"},{"text":"Government documentation"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Legal translation requires excellent terminology accuracy. Depending on the task, legal qualification may be useful, but a translator is not automatically authorised to provide legal advice."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Technical Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software"},{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"Hardware"},{"text":"User manuals"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Product specifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can be a particularly strong path because language + technical knowledge is harder to replace than general translation."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Medical Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Healthcare content"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical content"},{"text":"Medical education"},{"text":"Clinical/research material"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Accuracy and terminology discipline are critical."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Literary Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Novels"},{"text":"Poetry"},{"text":"Short stories"},{"text":"Essays"},{"text":"Literature"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This path rewards strong cultural and literary understanding."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Localization Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Adapt:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Apps"},{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Software"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Digital products"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest technology-oriented paths."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Subtitling & Media"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Films"},{"text":"OTT content"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Educational videos"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"News"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Subtitle formatting"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. AI Language Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"An emerging path combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Language","AI","Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI response evaluation"},{"text":"Language quality evaluation"},{"text":"Multilingual dataset creation"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Speech/text data annotation"},{"text":"Localization QA"},{"text":"Prompt evaluation"},{"text":"Language model testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can be a strong future-oriented path for language graduates."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not mandatory for becoming a translator."},{"type":"p","text":"Portfolio + language proficiency + specialisation + technology skills can be more important for many private-sector roles."},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. in Hindi"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Hindi"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Teaching"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Language careers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. in Regional Language"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"Marathi"},{"text":"Bengali"},{"text":"Gujarati"},{"text":"Punjabi"},{"text":"Odia"},{"text":"Urdu"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. Translation Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly relevant for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional translation"},{"text":"Translation theory"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Language research"},{"text":"Translation technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. Linguistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language technology"},{"text":"Computational linguistics"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Language analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PG Diploma in Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Can be useful for students who want focused professional training without pursuing a full master's degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in international language careers, relevant programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation Studies"},{"text":"Conference Interpreting"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"Applied Linguistics"},{"text":"Language Technology"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential career markets depend on language demand and work eligibility."},{"type":"p","text":"For an Indian-language specialist, international opportunities can exist in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multinational companies"},{"text":"Language-service providers"},{"text":"AI companies"},{"text":"Localization companies"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"International organisations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A traditional translation progression can look like:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Language Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Language Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Language Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation/Localization Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation Project Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Localization Manager / Language Operations Manager"}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Localization","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Translator"},{"type":"flow","items":["Localization Executive","Localization Specialist","Senior Localization Specialist","Localization Lead","Localization Manager","Global Localization Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly useful for technology, gaming, SaaS and e-commerce companies."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Language Technology","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Language"},{"type":"flow","items":["Language Data Associate","Linguistic Data Analyst","Language Quality Analyst","AI Language Specialist","NLP/Language Operations Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"This path becomes stronger when combined with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"NLP fundamentals"},{"text":"Data annotation"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Linguistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A language graduate does not necessarily need to become a full ML engineer to participate in language-AI workflows."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Content","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Translator"},{"type":"flow","items":["Bilingual Content Writer","Content Specialist","Senior Content Specialist","Content Strategist","Regional Content Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This can be especially useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital media"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Regional-language products"}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Future Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The traditional translation market will increasingly automate simple, repetitive translation."},{"type":"p","text":"Future demand is likely to shift toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"General translation"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-assisted."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Human expertise + AI."},{"type":"h","text":"Localization"},{"type":"p","text":"Human cultural adaptation + technology."},{"type":"h","text":"AI language work"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human evaluation","multilingual data","AI."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation management"},{"type":"p","text":"Human project and quality management + automation."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, students should avoid building their entire career around:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I know Hindi/Telugu/Tamil and English.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead, build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Language","Domain Expertise","Translation Technology","AI","Portfolio"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Strong AI-Era Combinations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Language + Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","CAT Tools","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Localization Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Law"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Legal Terminology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Legal Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Healthcare"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Medical Terminology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Medical Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Python/NLP"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Language Technology Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Media"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Video/Subtitling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Media Localization Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Marketing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Localization/Content Specialist"}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I have professional-level proficiency in my regional language and English, can translate and edit content accurately, understand cultural and contextual adaptation, use CAT and AI-assisted translation tools, maintain terminology consistency, and have a portfolio demonstrating work across multiple content types.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That is substantially more employable than simply listing:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Hindi/Telugu/Tamil – fluent.”"}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Hindi / Regional Language"},{"type":"flow","items":["Achieve excellent language proficiency","Build strong English writing skills","Study translation techniques","Practise bilingual translation every week","Learn editing and proofreading","Choose a domain:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal / Technical / Medical / Financial / Media / Marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learn CAT tools","Learn terminology management","Learn localization","Learn AI-assisted translation and MTPE","Complete translation/localization internship","Build a 10–15 sample portfolio","Apply for:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Translator / Translation Associate / Language Executive / Localization Executive"},{"type":"flow","items":["Gain professional experience","Specialise in a high-value domain","Progress toward:"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Translator","Language Specialist","Localization/Translation Lead","Translation/Localization Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best AI-era combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Language","English","Domain Expertise","CAT Tools","Localization","AI/MTPE","Strong Portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For students who want the strongest long-term opportunity, specialised translation and localization are generally more defensible career directions than relying only on general-purpose translation."}]}]}